      "text": "CHAYA JANU RAVAN  AGE. 56 YEARS, OCC. HOUSEWIFE,\n R/O BUGATE POST, ALUR,\n TQ. HUKKERI, DIST. BELAGAVI 591309.\n ...RESPONDENTS (BY SMT. KIRTILATA R. PATIL, HCGP FOR R1;\nSRI. A.M. GUNDAWADE, ADVOCATE FOR R2)\n THIS CRIMINAL PETITION IS FILED UNDER SECTION 528 OF BNSS, 2023, PRAYING TO QUASH THE ENTIRE PROCEEDINGS IN C.C.NO.3054/2024 FOR THE OFFENCES P/U/SEC. 498A,\n304B, 306, 506 R/W 34 OF IPC R/W 3 AND 4 OF DOWRY PROHIBITION ACT, 1961 PENDING ON THE FILE OF CIVIL JUDGE AND JMFC COURT, SANKESHWAR IN CONNECTION WITH FIR CRIME NO. 113/2024 DATED 03.09.2024 REGISTERED BY SANKESHWAR P.S. AND ALL FURTHER PROCEEDINGS PURSUANT THERETO WITH RESPECT TO PETITIONERS/ACCUSED NO. 1-4 IN THE INTEREST OF JUSTICE.\n THIS CRIMINAL PETITION COMING ON FOR ADMISSION,\nTHIS DAY, ORDER WAS MADE THEREIN AS UNDER:\n ORAL ORDER (PER: THE HON'BLE MR. JUSTICE V.SRISHANANDA)",
