      "text": "The memo reads as under:\n\"The Advocate for the petitioners herein submits that:\nPradeep S/O Maruti More vs The State Of Karnataka on 3 February, 2026 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/127276495/\n2",
